      "content": "i mean i know i should probably see someone but the urgent care is like an hour away and i don't really have the money for an ER visit right now... do you think it's actually serious? feels like something is just wrong. i've had migraines before but never like this. can i just take some extra ibuprofen and sleep it off for a few hours to see if it goes away?",
